    "For privacy questions: ai-platforms@fattouh.me": "隐私相关问题请联系：ai-platforms@fattouh.me",
    "Scan for free, subscribe to clean. Cancel anytime.": "免费扫描，订阅后清理。可随时取消。",
    "Runs entirely offline — no connection ever required.": "完全离线运行——从不需要任何网络连接。",
